<section class="section tech section--slate" id="principles" aria-labelledby="pr-title">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="head " data-reveal><p class="kicker">Principles</p><h2 id="pr-title">Built Around the Composer.</h2></div><ol class="principles"><li>The composer stays in charge. CuTTI suggests and prepares; the composer decides.</li><li>Stock instruments and plug-ins only.</li><li>Originality is checked. Every new part is compared against the reference material it learned from, and anything too close is rewritten.</li><li>It runs on the composer’s own Mac. A small local AI model only reads the brief.</li><li>Projects are never overwritten: every build is a new file.</li></ol><p class="small muted" data-mt="40">Logic Pro is a trademark of Apple Inc.; Cubase, Nuendo, WaveLab and Dorico are trademarks of Steinberg Media Technologies GmbH; Digital Performer is a trademark of MOTU, Inc. CuTTI is an independent project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by or a partner of these companies.</p>
